# Smart Wedding Planner — Multi-Agent System

Build a complete **Supervisor-Worker multi-agent wedding planner** as a new project in `c:\Users\m.bhaskar\agentic AI`, reusing the existing Gemini API setup from the `Ai` project.

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    User((User)) <-->|Chat| Frontend[React + Vite Frontend]
    Frontend <-->|REST API| Backend[Express Backend]
    Backend <-->|Orchestrates| Supervisor[Supervisor Agent]
    Supervisor <-->|Delegates| Agent1[Cultural Consultant]
    Supervisor <-->|Delegates| Agent2[Treasurer]
    Supervisor <-->|Delegates| Agent3[Logistics Scout]
    Supervisor <-->|Delegates| Agent4[Vendor Orchestrator]
    Supervisor --- State[(Shared Wedding State)]
    Agent1 --- State
    Agent2 --- State
    Agent3 --- State
    Agent4 --- State
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The system uses **Gemini API** (already available via the user's API key) as the LLM backbone for all agents. No additional LLM subscriptions needed.

